---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About - Anup Sahoo" currentPage="about">
  <header style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:48px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:20px;">About</h1>
    <p style="font-size:20px;color:#cbd5e1;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">
      Enterprise AI architect helping organizations build scalable, responsible AI systems.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section style="margin-bottom:60px;">
    <div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:20px;color:#60a5fa;">My Journey</h2>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:18px;">
            I'm a technology leader with over 15 years of experience building enterprise-scale systems. 
            My journey has taken me from traditional software architecture to the cutting edge of AI and machine learning.
          </p>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:18px;">
            For the past decade, I've been focused on helping organizations navigate the complex landscape 
            of AI adoption. From designing ML pipelines to implementing governance frameworks, I've worked 
            with teams across industries to build AI systems that are not just powerful, but also responsible 
            and sustainable.
          </p>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;font-size:18px;">
            This platform is my way of sharing the insights, patterns, and playbooks I've developed 
            along the way. My goal is to help other engineers and leaders accelerate their AI journey 
            while avoiding common pitfalls.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-bottom:60px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:30px;text-align:center;">Areas of Expertise</h2>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">🏗️</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">AI Architecture</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
          Designing scalable, maintainable AI systems using modern architectural patterns and best practices.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">🔧</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">MLOps Engineering</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
          Building robust ML pipelines, CI/CD for machine learning, and automated model deployment systems.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">🛡️</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">AI Governance</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
          Implementing responsible AI practices, ethical guidelines, and compliance frameworks for enterprise AI.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">📊</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">Data Strategy</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
          Developing comprehensive data strategies that enable successful AI adoption and data-driven decision making.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">🚀</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">Cloud & DevOps</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
          Leveraging cloud platforms and DevOps practices to build scalable, resilient AI infrastructure.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:24px;">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">💡</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">Technology Leadership</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
          Leading engineering teams, driving technical strategy, and fostering innovation in complex organizations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-bottom:60px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:30px;text-align:center;">What I Share Here</h2>
    <div style="background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));gap:24px;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">📝 Architecture Patterns</h3>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;">
            Proven patterns for building enterprise AI systems that scale and evolve with your needs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">🎯 Implementation Guides</h3>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;">
            Step-by-step playbooks for common AI implementation scenarios and challenges.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">🔍 Technology Analysis</h3>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;">
            Honest evaluations of AI tools, platforms, and technologies based on real-world experience.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;color:#60a5fa;">📈 Lessons Learned</h3>
          <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px;">
            Successes, failures, and insights from years of building AI systems in production.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 style="font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:30px;text-align:center;">Let's Connect</h2>
    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
        I'm always interested in connecting with fellow practitioners, sharing insights, and learning from others' experiences. 
        Whether you're just starting your AI journey or deep in the trenches of enterprise implementation, 
        I'd love to hear from you.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="https://github.com/anupsahoo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background:#2563eb;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/anupsahoo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background:#2563eb;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/anupsahoo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background:#2563eb;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;">Twitter</a>
        <a href="mailto:contact@anupsahoo.com" style="border:1px solid #334155;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;color:#e2e8f0;font-weight:500;">Email</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>